></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ 관생실 배정공고 : <font color=\"#0900ff\">파일 첨부</font></span></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 입사 준비물 및 방법</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 신분증 : 주민등록증, 운전면허증, 여권 중 택 1 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>(학생증 제외)</strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 개인 비품 : 침구류, 세면도구 등 개인 생활 용품</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 입실 방법 : 입사 등록 후 입실</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 입사 등록</span></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 절차 : 본인확인 → 열쇠 수령 </span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 일정 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#e80909\">2014. 8. 30(토) ~ 8. 31(일) 14:00~18:00</font></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong><font color=\"#e80909\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">30일 14시 이전에는 입사 불가)</span></font></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 장소 : 푸름관1,2동 입사자-푸름관 2동 경비실</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 푸름관 3,4동 입사자-푸름관3동 경비실</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 오름관-오름관 식당, 신평관-신평관1층&nbsp;</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 입사&nbsp;시간 외 입사 : 푸름관-3동 경비실, 오름관-방재실, 신평관-1층 현관</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 2학기 짐 보관자 짐 수령</span></strong></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;1. 절차 : 본인확인(신분증) →&nbsp;짐 수령 </span></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;2.&nbsp;일시 : 2014. 8. 30(토) ~ 8. 31(일) 13:00~18:00</span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;3. 장소 : 푸름관 입사자-푸름관 1동 다목적실</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 오름관 입사자-오름관 체력단련실</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong></strong></span></strong></span>&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 식수 혈관 등록</span></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -68.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 시간 : </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">입사일 14:00～18:00, (입사 기간 외에는 식사시간에 등록)</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 장소 : 각 관 식당</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 방법 : 신분증 제시 후 식수 혈관 등록</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 식사 : 8. 30(토) 저녁부터 제공 <font color=\"#0900ff\">(5일식 신청자도 8.30~31 식사 가능)</font></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">입사 택배&nbsp;안내</span></strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : <strong>입사 전 생활관으로 보내는 짐 택배(옷, 생필품 등)는 보관할 장소(경비실 협소)가 없고 분실할 우려가 있으므로 입실 날 직접 짐을 가지고 오거나 입실 날에 맞추어 택배가 도착할 수 있도록 조정하여 본인이 직접 택배를 수령하시기 바랍니다. (예-목요일에 택배 발송시 토요일 중 택배가 도착하므로 토요일에&nbsp;입사를&nbsp;완료하여&nbsp;직접&nbsp;택배 수령)</strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -24.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.1pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 기타 안내</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></font></p><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; ※&nbsp;개사기간 - 2014.8.30(토) 14:00～12.22(월) 14:00</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">결핵검사 - 입사 후 9월 중 단체 X선 촬영</span></span></p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp; ※</font><font color=\"#0900ff\"> 푸름관 1동 자율관 폐지(2013-2학기부터 시범운영결과 관생수칙 위반사례 증가 등&nbsp;지속적으로 </font></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;문제점이 발생하여 이전과 같이 통금 실시)</font></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014. 8. 27.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교 생활관장</span></span></p></font></div></font></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
